# Scheduler runtime state. runCount/lastStatus/nextRun are rewritten on every
# agent run, so tracking this file guarantees a dirty worktree and deadlocks
# the release gate. The durable half (loop definitions) is snapshotted by
# Scripts/ops/snapshot-schedules.sh into docs/ops/schedules-snapshot.json.
.pi/subagent-schedules/
